#
# Paths that tools/release/make-snapshot.py leaves out of the public
# snapshot commit (docs/release/snapshot.md, "The cleaned tree").
#
# Format: '#' comment lines and blank lines are ignored; every other line is
# one literal path relative to the repository root, no globs; a line ending
# in '/' excludes that directory and everything below it. A path is listed
# only when a recorded owner decision, cited in a comment above the line,
# says it leaves the public tree.
#
# Nothing is decided beyond what has already left the tree: the scope cut of
# decision 3 of #1606 (tools/mali/board-ref/, docs/board-sessions/) was
# applied to the tree itself (docs/release/redaction-audit.md, Part 3), and
# records/* is gitignored, so no tree holds either. The list is therefore
# empty. Each candidate that is not decided is an owner question under
# "Undecided" in docs/release/snapshot.md; do not add one here without a
# recorded decision.
